DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
8081::$$$message_0057_0000_0000$$$::"Hm... That's odd. I had a feeling it was around here...[lr]::
8082::$$$message_0057_0000_0001$$$::Maybe I shouldn't bother if I can't find it... It's always the things that are hard to locate that end up bringing me trouble once I find them."::
8083::$$$message_0057_0001_0000$$$::...?[lr]::
8084::$$$message_0057_0001_0001$$$::There's a boy in the temple grounds.[lr]::
8085::$$$message_0057_0001_0002$$$::With 24-carat gold hair and ruby-red eyes, he's sure to stand out in a crowd.::
8086::$$$message_0057_0002_0000$$$::He's walking around the courtyard, seemingly looking for something he's dropped.[clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400][lr]::
8087::$$$message_0057_0002_0001$$$::"Hello, mister. Nice weather today, isn't it?"[lr]::
8088::$$$message_0057_0002_0002$$$::He greets me amiably.::
8089::$$$message_0057_0003_0000$$$::"Oh. H-hi. Hello."[lr]::
8090::$$$message_0057_0003_0001$$$::"Hi. I mean, it's good to see you. You're very polite, aren't you?[lr]::
8091::$$$message_0057_0003_0002$$$::That's very pleasing to see. I hope you keep up that simple candor."[lr]::
8092::$$$message_0057_0003_0003$$$::The blond boy bids me farewell.::
8093::$$$message_0057_0004_0000$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
8094::$$$message_0057_0004_0001$$$::Um...what?[lr]::
8095::$$$message_0057_0004_0002$$$::"It's still too soon for me to come here.[lr]::
8096::$$$message_0057_0004_0003$$$::Hmm... I know. Once you learn my name and obtain a meaningful item, try visiting the area behind the temple at the same time as today."::
8097::$$$message_0057_0005_0000$$$::He leaves, his footsteps echoing lightly.[lr]::
8098::$$$message_0057_0005_0001$$$::The sound is soft, but his pace is like that of a hunting dog.[lr]::
8099::$$$message_0057_0005_0002$$$::"...What was that all about?"[lr]::
8100::$$$message_0057_0005_0003$$$::Thus ends the strange encounter,[lr]::
8101::$$$message_0057_0005_0004$$$::in the early afternoon at Ryudou Temple.::
908081::$$$message_9057_0000_0000$$$::"Hm... That's odd. I had a feeling it was around here..."::N�